## Verdicts

```mdl
verdict Book: The Book type exists but its shape differs from the spec: catalog fields are nested, owned is public, personalTags and format are absent.
  status: diverged
  evidence: [github:dxos/dxos/packages/plugins/plugin-library/src/types/Book.ts#Book, github:dxos/dxos/packages/plugins/plugin-library/src/types/Book.ts#Catalog]
  tests: [github:dxos/dxos/packages/plugins/plugin-library/src/atproto/book-lens.test.ts]
  note: |
    `title`, `authors`, `genres`, cover and `identifiers.hiveId` live under `catalog` (`Catalog` struct) rather than top-level;
    `coverUrl` is `catalog.cover`. `owned` is annotated `publish` (spec: private), `review`/`notes` are `Ref<Text>`, and
    `personalTags`, `format` and a stored `hiveBookUri` are missing (the URI is derived by the lens). Adds `progress` and `content`.
```

